</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d40ea356-a143-11f1-adf0-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/China-USA-EU.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d40ea356-a143-11f1-adf0-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/China-USA-EU.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b92b41d8-a13f-11f1-a825-d5a31949f6ae</guid><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:49:13 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d40ea356-a143-11f1-adf0-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/China-USA-EU.jpg">© 网络合成图片</source><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>聚焦台海</category><title>《台湾21世纪恐怖片》｜法国学者柯汉东：鬼岛怎么可以没有一本书来探讨台湾近代电影中的鬼怪叙事</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%81%9A%E7%84%A6%E5%8F%B0%E6%B5%B7/20260826-%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE21%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E6%81%90%E6%80%96%E7%89%87-%EF%BD%9C%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85%E6%9F%AF%E6%B1%89%E4%B8%9C-%E9%AC%BC%E5%B2%9B%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC%E4%B9%A6%E6%9D%A5%E6%8E%A2%E8%AE%A8%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E8%BF%91%E4%BB%A3%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%AC%BC%E6%80%AA%E5%8F%99%E4%BA%8B</link><description>
